Package: dpgof
Title: Distance Profile Goodness-of-Fit Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Diego", "Serrano", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dieserra@est-econ.uc3m.es")
Description: Multiplier bootstrap goodness-of-fit tests based on distance
    profiles for Euclidean, directional, hyperbolic, and compositional data.
